decision_flow:
flowchart TD
  A{Zero-shot passes the eval bar?} -->|Yes| B[Stop at zero-shot]
  A -->|No| C{Output format wrong?}
  C -->|Yes| D[Add structured outputs or tags]
  C -->|No| E{Reasoning needed?}
  E -->|Yes| F[Use adaptive thinking]
  E -->|No| G[Add 3 to 5 diverse examples]
  G --> H{Eval bar passed?}
  H -->|No| I[Climb one rung and run evals again]
